                }
              ],
              "value": "Membrane attack complex (MAC) assembly is inhibited by CD59, thereby protecting self-cells from damage during complement activation (PubMed:36797260). MAC assembly is also inhibited by clusterin (CLU) chaperones that inhibit polymerization of C9 (PubMed:34667172)"
            }
          ],
